sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / CLI
    participant TG as TradingAgentsGraph
    participant LG as LangGraph runtime
    participant AN as Analysts (×3)
    participant DB as Bull/Bear + RM
    participant TR as Trader
    participant RD as Risk Debators (×3)
    participant PM as Portfolio Manager
    participant RG as Risk Gate
    participant MP as Mark Price
    participant EX as Executor
    participant BN as Binance Testnet
    participant FS as JSONL Log

    U->>TG: propagate(ticker, date)
    TG->>LG: graph.invoke(initial_state)
    LG->>AN: market / sentiment / news
    AN-->>LG: *_report 字段
    LG->>DB: Bull / Bear loop
    DB-->>LG: investment_plan
    LG->>TR: 读 plan + analyst 报告
    TR-->>LG: trader_investment_plan (FuturesProposal)
    LG->>RD: Aggressive / Conservative / Neutral loop
    RD-->>LG: risk_debate_state.history
    LG->>PM: 读辩论 + plan + proposal
    PM-->>LG: final_decision_structured (FuturesDecision)
    LG->>RG: 读 final_decision_structured + equity
    RG->>FS: 读 events → derive snapshot
    alt 规则通过
        RG-->>LG: execution_intent (dict)
        LG->>MP: 读 intent
        MP->>BN: GET fapi mainnet premiumIndex
        BN-->>MP: mark price
        MP-->>LG: mark_price
        LG->>EX: 读 intent + mark_price
        EX->>BN: change_leverage + MARKET open
        BN-->>EX: orderId
        EX->>BN: STOP_MARKET reduceOnly
        alt 保护单成功
            BN-->>EX: orderId / algoId
            EX->>BN: TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET (可选)
            BN-->>EX: orderId / algoId
            EX->>FS: append position_opened
            EX-->>LG: execution_result (success)
        else 保护单失败
            EX->>BN: MARKET reduceOnly (unwind)
            alt unwind 成功
                BN-->>EX: ok
                EX->>FS: append trade_skipped
                EX-->>LG: execution_result (success=False)
            else unwind 失败
                BN--xEX: error
                EX->>FS: position_opened + position_naked
                EX-->>LG: execution_result (position_naked=True)
            end
        end
    else 规则拒绝
        RG->>FS: append trade_skipped
        RG-->>LG: execution_intent = None
        Note over MP,EX: 下游节点全部短路 no-op
    end
    LG-->>TG: final_state
    TG-->>U: (final_state, processed_signal)
